lindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229863,"global_rank":136909,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":22403},{"name":"amelntamark/algorithms-and-data-structures","owner":"amelntamark","html_url":"https://github.com/amelntamark/algorithms-and-data-structures","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Implementations of algorithms and data structures in Python.","topics":[],"score":229862,"global_rank":136922,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":22404},{"name":"denised/pd-excel-tools","owner":"denised","html_url":"https://github.com/denised/pd-excel-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Tools used to manage Excel->Python translation for PD","topics":[],"score":229855,"global_rank":136934,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":22405},{"name":"pdflynn/gnuradio-senior-design-sandbox","owner":"pdflynn","html_url":"https://github.com/pdflynn/gnuradio-senior-design-sandbox","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Sandbox for senior design project.","topics":[],"score":229850,"global_rank":136943,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":22406},{"name":"nathanstuart01/flask_demo","owner":"nathanstuart01","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanstuart01/flask_demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":2,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229848,"global_rank":136948,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":22407},{"name":"burcellf/simple_protein_ode","owner":"burcellf","html_url":"https://github.com/burcellf/simple_protein_ode","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229846,"global_rank":136957,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":22408},{"name":"damatoaj/modules_